<title>LITHUANIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MARCH 27.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MARCH 27.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the leading headlines broadcasted on Lithuania's M-1 plus radio station at noon on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Parliament on Thursday approved the appointment of Kazys Pednyche to the post of prosecutor general.</p>
<p>- The president of the radio and television association, Gintaras Songaila, expects that the advertising of tobacco and alochol will be limited along European Union standards.</p>
<p>--Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 22 35 17</p>
